description:
Design a combinational logic circuit that outputs a fixed 32-bit value based on the parameter P. If P is 1, the output is 2; if P is 2, the output is 3; if P is 3, the output is 5; and for any other value of P, the output defaults to 7. This module effectively serves as a parameterized constant value generator.
module top_module(
    output wire [31:0] out
);

code:
module top_module(
    output wire [31:0] out
);parameter P = 0;
    if (P == 1)
        assign out = 2;
    else if (P == 2)
        assign out = 3;
    else if (P == 3)
        assign out = 5;
    else
        assign out = 7;
endmodule

