description:
Design a synchronous one-bit flip-flop that captures the input signal on the rising edge of a clock. When the input 'in' is high, the output 'out' is set to high; otherwise, it is set to low. This module effectively acts as a simple memory element that reflects the input state based on the clock signal.
module top_module(
  input wire in,
  input wire clk,
  output reg out
);

code:
module top_module(
  input wire in,
  input wire clk,
  output reg out
);always @(posedge clk) begin
    if (in) out <= 1'b1;
    else out <= 1'b0;
  end

endmodule

